# The math font web/dist/ ships a subset of, and the licence that must travel
# with it. One line per file: name, then the URL it comes from.
#
# A raw blob at a *tag* rather than a release asset or a generated tarball:
# stipub/stixfonts publishes no release assets at all, and its built fonts live
# only in the git tree. A blob URL at a tag is byte-stable in a way GitHub's
# generated tarballs are not — the same reason THIRD-PARTY.md gives for hashing
# the corpora per file rather than trusting an archive.
#
# v2.13b171 is the newest tag carrying built fonts under fonts/static_otf_woff2.
# Later tags (v2.14) are source-only.

STIXTwoMath-Regular.woff2  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stipub/stixfonts/v2.13b171/fonts/static_otf_woff2/STIXTwoMath-Regular.woff2
OFL.txt                    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stipub/stixfonts/v2.13b171/OFL.txt
